393→Samples position and normal attributes from a NURBS surface (input 1) using dynamically calculated UV coordinates that animate in a circular pattern over time. The UV coordinates are generated using sine and cosine functions, remapped from -1,1 to 0.2,0.8 range, then offset to center the sampling region, with primuv() extracting both position and normal at those coordinates.
